ed-solution "Let's examine each of the vector spaces in turn.\n\n- Recall that $\\text{dim}({R}_{n}[t])=n+1.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}_{10}[t])=10+1=11\\ne 10.\\,\\times \n$$\n- Recall that $\\text{dim}({\\text{M}}_{n}(\\text{R}))={n}^{2}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({\\text{M}}_{5}(R))={5}^{2}=25\\ne 10.\\,\\times \n$$\n- Recall that $\\text{dim}({R}^{n})=n.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}^{10})=10.\\,✓\n$$\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-106897/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "aee17e3a-031d-5c0e-9488-17410b3a2372"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-106897"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-106901/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "9d918f0e-0d9a-5d11-bc36-d7a1fb7e0203" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106901/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "bd0835a5-3b50-51d9-ae30-835c1b352299" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106901/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "3c7697a2-0178-5cb6-adaf-419c590e16c3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106901/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "cb9b72e8-d0ae-512a-ae29-36b72b8a24fa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106901/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "8ec9ccc6-5a60-5c05-9945-06756853743d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106901/selection" :answer